    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS are delighted to present this beautifully finished 3-bedroom, 2-bathroom semi-detached house on Kilmacud Road Upper, Dundrum, Dublin 16.\nThis fantastic property has been finished to a high standard throughout, with a bright, open-plan kitchen/dining/living area leading out to a generous private patio and rear garden, three well-proportioned bedrooms, a main fully-tiled bathroom plus a guest WC downstairs. The home also benefits from a gravel driveway for multiple cars.\nIn terms of location, Kilmacud Road Upper is within easy reach of Dundrum, Stillorgan and Sandyford, Dundrum Town Centre, and local shops, schools & parks. The nearest Luas stops, Balally P&R and Kilmacud, are both approximately a 12-minute walk, a 4-minute cycle, or a 2-minute drive away, with the Green Line offering a direct journey into Dublin City Centre in approximately 25 minutes. Local bus routes also serve the area with a bus stop located directly outside the property, giving further options for commuting into the city centre and surrounding areas.\nFeatures:\n1.Semi-detached\n2.Fully furnished\n3.Private patio and garden\n4.3 bedrooms\n5.2 bathrooms\n6.Bright Open-Plan Kitchen/Dining/Living Area\n7.Gravel Driveway with Off-Street Parking\n8.Utility Area\n9.Bus Stop Directly Outside\n10.Kilmacud Luas stop 2 minutes' away\n11.Minutes from Dundrum Town Centre\nAvailable Immediately!\nENQUIRIES BY EMAIL ONLY PLEASE.\n"
      },
      {
